## Context
Level 4 evaluation tests whether the method generalizes. Same pipeline,
different country and reference data. Workers make this straightforward:
new sweep YAML, same infrastructure.

## Actions
1. Select second country and build reference dataset
2. Adapt prompts for new country
3. Run full sweep via Workers
4. Test with updated reference data for temporal stability

## Exit criteria
- Pipeline runs on second country without code changes
- Results comparable to Vietnam benchmark
- Temporal stability measured with updated reference
